    {
      "id": "claim_b27dda9c5141417a89822628f5a68a41",
      "statement": "Retention's safety property is that a failed or partial run prunes nothing, and a prune failure never fails the run — it is recorded separately in pruneFailureReason distinct from the run's failureReason.",
