      "id": "claim_9cac7cd812c7450787ce7cf2cd35f001",
      "statement": "Revocation ordering on disabling a schedule, deleting a job, or deleting the account is revoke-at-Keycloak-first, forget-locally-second, so a failed revocation never strands a live non-expiring offline token with no local record pointing at it.",
